WindScout

Smart VPN finder for Windscribe · یابنده‌ی هوشمند VPN برای ویندسکرایب

English · فارسی
English

Short description (GitHub "About"):

    Smart Windscribe auto-connect & network scanner for filtered networks — finds the working server, protocol and port, and learns your network. (FA/EN)

WindScout is a Windows desktop tool that finds the best working Windscribe connection on your network. It measures how your internet is filtered, tests servers, protocols and ports, then connects automatically — and gets smarter after every scan.
Features

    Smart connect – one click: checks filtering, picks the best server/protocol/port from this network's history, and watches tunnel health (auto-reconnect).
    Real verification – a connection only counts as successful when real HTTPS passes and your exit IP/country actually changes.
    Scanner – Smart (discover → expand), City-by-city and Chaos modes; filters by continent/city/location; port selection and protocol priority; profiles.
    Speed test & network check – download/upload/ping, UDP availability, SNI (DPI) filtering, DNS tampering, open TCP ports, then real server suggestions.
    Results & Best – searchable table with CSV export, stored per network; see which protocol/port works and the fastest servers.
    Favorites and Hide IP (for screenshots/videos).
    Bilingual UI – Persian / English (FA/EN button in the top bar).
    Portable – bundled Python runtime, no install needed.

Requirements

    Windows 10/11
    Windscribe (opens in a new tab) desktop app installed and signed in

Usage

    Download and extract the whole folder (don't run from inside the zip).
    Run WindScout.exe (keep the runtime and app folders next to it).
    If SmartScreen warns you: More info → Run anyway.

